        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In managing our business, we focus on a number of measures and objectives with respect to the attraction, development and retention of our employees that we believe are important to our business, including communication, compensation, professional development, inclusion, health, well-being and safety:",
