        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our ability to rapidly develop innovative products is in large part attributable to the fully integrated product innovation process that we have implemented, and the management philosophy behind that process.",
